The user should check the deployment YAMLs for the geo, profile, and rate services to see how the environment variables are defined. If they're using a ConfigMap or Secret, ensure that the ConfigMap or Secret exists and has the correct MongoDB URLs. Also, verify that the service names in the environment variables match the actual MongoDB service names in the cluster, like mongodb-geo, mongodb-profile, etc.

