RL, MONGODB_PROFILE, MONGODB_RATE) in their deployments. These services lack configuration to connect to their respective MongoDB instances (mongodb-geo, mongodb-profile, mongodb-rate), leading to connection failures and crashes. The deployments for geo, profile, and rate do not define environment variables for database connections, causing the services to fail during startup. This misconfiguration results in repeated restarts as the pods cannot establish database connectivity."}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=397, prompt_tokens=18362, total_tokens=18759, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cff35-2966-7621-a101-cb986653b9e2-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 18362, 'output_tokens': 397, 'total_tokens': 18759}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='b62a0ac0-8c12-42a2-a310-01f678d5e6d6')]]
